{
  "name": "鬼步刺青 Ghost Step Tattoo",
  "type": "equipment",
  "img": "icons/tools/scribal/burnisher-tooth.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"wordsection1\"><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">覆盖区域：两条肢体，或者胸膛，或者上背部</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">该魔法刺青用一根特殊的针制作，图案于你身上各处闪烁、模糊不清。</span><span> <br></span><em><strong>刺青同调。 </strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">同调此物品时，你需要将针持握，并抵在你想要让刺</span><span class=\"GramE\">青出现</span>的那处皮肤上。当同调完成时，针头会化为墨水再变成刺青。若你与刺青的同调结束，刺青会消失，针头会再次出现在你的位置中。<span><br></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em><strong>鬼灵形态</strong></em></span><em> <strong>。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">刺</span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">青具有</span> <span>3 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能，且每天黎明时恢复所有已消耗的充能。刺青在你的皮肤上时，作为一个附赠动作，你可以消耗</span> 1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发刺青的充能变为虚体，直到你的下个回合开始。在持续时间内，你获得以下增益：</span></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">你获得对非魔法武器的钝击、穿刺 和挥砍抗性。</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">你不会被 擒抱 Grappled 或 束缚 Restrained</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family:Signika, sans-serif\">你可以像穿过困难地形那样穿过其他生物或物件。如果你在回合结束时处于固体物件内则受到1d10 力场伤害。如果效果结束时你处于固体物件内，你会被排出到最近一处未被占据的空间，并且每移动 5尺就受到[[/r 1d10]]力场伤害。</span></p></li></ul></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
